: 14pt\"> 10:00~18:00(자세한 일정 및 장소는 추후 공지)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -260.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 260.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">◈ 모집인원 : 제한 없음</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">◈ 상금</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;</span> </p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"29\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"156\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">구 분</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"29\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"197\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">상 금(원)</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; B